    <values><field>LongDescription__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">Finds: RateCardEntry records with Price null or zero.
Why it matters: Entries with no price produce no revenue — products linked to this rate card sell at $0 (or fail to price entirely). Direct margin loss on every line.
Suppress a finding: when the $0 is genuinely intentional (free tier, sample).
Disable the detector: leave on.</value></values>
